      "message": "fix: correct fee math for clnrest and corelightningrest backends\n\nThis commit corrects a bug where the fee amount in msat was incorrectly calculated as a negative number in the 'clnrest' and 'corelightningrest' lightning backends. Regression tests are added to ensure this correctly subtracts 'amount_msat' from 'amount_sent_msat' going forward.",
